  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Secluded Library</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Communication sphere, Posse Commander; or War sphere, Squadron Commander; or Warleader sphere, Troop Commander.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> Choose a creature when you gain this feat. That creature does not count towards the maximum number of creatures in your squadron and you never need to renew your bond to keep that creature in your squadron. Whenever you use a Squadron feat that normally requires spending a spell point, plan, or martial focus, you do not need to spend the resource if it only affects creatures you have selected with this feat.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You may select this feat multiple times, each time selecting a different creature. If you have the Bonded Casting drawback, you may select this feat as a drawback feat.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/drawback-feats#toc52\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
